OL,3,GNEWSAArtists paint boards to raise
OL,4,Amoney for skate park
OL,5,
OL,6,FArtists have painted skateboard decks
OL,7,Fto be exhibited and then auctioned to
OL,8,Ffund a new skate park.
OL,10,FMore than 40 skateboard decks are on
OL,11,Fdisplay at the Station Gallery in Frome
OL,12,Funtil 27 September, to raise the
OL,13,F#400,000 that is needed.
OL,15,FThe exhibition has been organised by
OL,16,FFrome Skatepark Project, a volunteer
OL,17,Fgroup working to help raise the money.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
