OL,3,GNEWSAArtists paint boards to raise
OL,4,Amoney for skate park
OL,5,
OL,6,FKim Martin from the project, said:
OL,7,F"We've got work from brilliant artists
OL,8,Ffrom Frome and further afield, with an
OL,9,Fextraordinary range of styles. Seeing
OL,10,Fmore than 40 of them together in one
OL,11,Fspace is going to be pretty special."
